notes.notes:
After a lot of playtesting and bug-fixing, we've finally launched the next update.

Here's a quick run-down of the main changes:

The new character, Bartolomeo Bosco: To shoot his old, trusty rifle you'll need to create some gunpowder, mixing three base ingredients in the right amounts. After loading the rifle Bosco prepares for his trick, pointing the rifle to himself and pulling the trigger, shooting his opponent and coming out as if nothing happened. We hope you like him, as we put a lot of time and effort in designing his gameplay and style and in balancing him.

A new mode, Arcade: Show everyone you're the Grand Magus, taking on a series of duels with every magician to obtain the mighty title. The difficulty levels should help to give everyone a fair chance at winning and, if needed, we will add other settings to give a hand to the more casual players or to add a bigger challenge.

Minor improvements:
-The possibility to have a random character in tournament mode;
-Improved UI with new animations;
-An improved guide screen;
-A lot of fixes and (hopefully) optimizations.

Thanks everyone for their support, we hope you like this new update. As always, leave suggestions here in the comments. We also created a pinned thread on the steam community to report bug, so if anything seems out of order we ask you to report it there. See you ingame!
